    "text": "Thank you. What date and time window can the food be picked up?",
    "at": "2026-11-05T18:52:21"
   },
   {
    "role": "caller",
    "text": "The food can be picked up tomorrow between six and eight in the evening.",
    "at": "2026-11-05T18:52:29"
   },
   {
    "role": "agent",
    "text": "Got it. How many pastries and muffins do you have, roughly?",
    "at": "2026-11-05T18:52:32"
   },
   {
    "role": "caller",
    "text": "We have about two large boxes of pastries and muffins.",
    "at": "2026-11-05T18:52:40"
   },
   {
    "role": "agent",
    "text": "Thanks. What is the pickup address for Sunrise Bagels?",
    "at": "2026-11-05T18:52:42"
